#: ../../source/css-declaration-sorter_readme.md:9
msgid ""
"A Node.js module and [PostCSS] plugin to sort CSS declarations based on "
"their property names. Ensuring the CSS is organized, more consistent and "
"in order... Besides, sorted CSS is smaller when gzipped because there "
"will be more similar strings. The intention of this module is to sort the"
" source CSS code of a project in the build process. Check out [the Atom "
"package](https://github.com/Siilwyn/css-declaration-sorter-atom) for "
"individual usage."
msgstr ""

